Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: python, python-pip
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://phoneintel.github.io
Description: Phone number intelligence and validation tool
 phoneintel is a Python library for validating and gathering
 information about phone numbers, including carrier, location,
 and line type detection.
